          "finding": "GITHUB_EVENT_NAME survives cleanEnvironment, so in a CI pull request job jest runs the existing skill-record fixtures in pull request mode. With the fixture helper inheriting process.env, 10 of 12 tests failed (pr5d/ci-env-without-isolation.log). The helper now unsets it.",
