          "cites": "Steps 2",
          "none": "Workflow edits are out of scope for 5d. docs/skills.md Limits says so, and work/skill-process-evidence/ci-range-checks.patch is the pending activation."
        },
        {
          "finding": "A rebase merge rewrites every SHA. A replay of the stack onto e22c06d shared no SHA with the branch, and skills:check e22c06d HEAD still passed outside pull request mode, through patch-ids and the base binding.",
          "cites": "Steps 5",
          "none": "Proved in pr5d/rebase-merge-simulation-8ac891b.log. No change needed."
        }
